{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - User - Account - Okta User Account Locked Out",
	"Description": "An Okta account was locked out by the sign-on policy's failed attempt limit. One lockout is a forgotten password; several across different accounts in a short window is a password attack hitting the limit.\n\nEvent types: user.account.lock, user.account.lock.limit\n\nReference(s):\n- https://support.okta.com/help/s/article/User-Signin-and-Recovery-Events-in-the-Okta-System-Log\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/",
